{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9905dc607fa551e9","name":"The Millennium Falcon","source":{"id":"source:reference-9905dc607fa551e9","title":"The Millennium Falcon","revision":18828,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:48:26Z","sha256":"7d5b96ad66f42b4813082e6f8b86dca3b6d4f930b7261b9fd89b33102413c238","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18828","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Millennium%20Falcon&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9905dc607fa551e9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Millennium Falcon"]}," is among the most famous ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," in the galaxy. Originally a stock ",{"tag":"a","children":["YT-1300"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/YT-1300"},", it's not clear how many hands and technicians the vessel went through before it came to the possession of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lando Calrissian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lando_Calrissian","referenceId":"reference:ad9ea8d29f7eda36"},". Though cobbled together from different ships, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Falcon"]}," is proof that the whole is often more important than the sum of its parts. It is often flown under false registration, and has often been identified as the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Argos"]},", ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sunlight Franchise"]},", ",{"tag":"i","children":["Longshot"]},", and ",{"tag":"i","children":["Shadow Bird"]},", among other aliases.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It served ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lando Calrissian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lando_Calrissian","referenceId":"reference:ad9ea8d29f7eda36"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Princess Leia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Princess_Leia"}," and was at various points piloted by any number of copilots and allies. (For this reason, the statistics given here assume a \"typical\" ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"}," of Ace smugglers; if the ship is encountered with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lando Calrissian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lando_Calrissian","referenceId":"reference:ad9ea8d29f7eda36"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"}," flying it, their abilities may be used rather than those of a generic crew.)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Millennium Falcon"]}," is a fast, agile ship able to take and dish out considerably more damage than its appearance would suggest. Any other description of its abilities is a generalization and guess, because the ship is constantly modified, upgraded, damaged, jury-rigged, and redesigned. The configuration given here is typical, and a good representation of the ship's status as of the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},". At this time it has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Smuggler's Compartments"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Smuggler%27s_Compartments","referenceId":"reference:6224a00fc8bd0549"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cargo Jettison System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cargo_Jettison_System","referenceId":"reference:de7d55268f2206fd"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medical Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medical_Suite","referenceId":"reference:b3eb2bc005b2b1ad"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Docking Clamps"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Docking_Clamps","referenceId":"reference:b4a9e9f91fcb2a40"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hypertransceiver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hypertransceiver"},", and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Array Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Array_Computer","referenceId":"reference:e0dbafa916e7f69b"}," (+2, included in statistics).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Ace)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Millennium Falcon"]}," Statistics (CL 12)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal* ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +6; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["*This ship is treated as a Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," for the purposes of being targeted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," weapons, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfighting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfighting"},", and using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"},"."]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://s